            "name": "Data Encrypted for Impact",
            "description": "[confidence=low, sources=static] [from D3D11InstallHelper.dll] The malware string 'WriteFile' was found in the binary. This string is characteristic of Data Encrypted for Impact behavior. The presence of this specific string alone (no other Data Encrypted for Impact-related string corroborates it) indicates the malware has capabilities associated with this technique, but with less certainty than a corroborated combination would. | [from 66VOAk0O.exe] The malware string 'WriteFile' was found in the binary. This string is characteristic of Data Encrypted for Impact behavior. The presence of this specific string alone (no other Data Encrypted for Impact-related string corroborates it) indicates the malware has capabilities associated with this technique, but with less certainty than a corroborated combination would.",
